## A — `graph::image_name`

One-sentence: `image_name` = file-name-with-extension as `String`, the canonical display/link key for images reused in graph, tree, editor lookups, rename/relink and copy-link.

Definition — `src/views/graph.rs:43-49`:
```rust
/// Name of an image in the graph and in links: its file name.
pub fn image_name(path: &Path) -> String {
    path.file_name().unwrap_or_default().to_string_lossy().into_owned()
}
```

Every use (`CodeSearch image_name`, no others besides these):
- `src/views/graph.rs:64-67` (`edges()`): `image_name(image).to_lowercase()` keyed into `by_name` after notes+aliases. Snippet: `.entry(image_name(image).to_lowercase()).or_insert(notes.len()+i)`. Breaks if gone: graph loses note→image edges (`resolves_edges` test `[(0,2)]` fails).
- `src/views/graph.rs:288-294` (`Graph::set_notes`): `.chain(images.iter().map(|p| (p.clone(), image_name(p).into())))`. Breaks if gone: image node labels in graph.
- `src/shell/menu.rs:209-210` (rename): `(graph::image_name(&path), graph::image_name(&to))` as `(old,new)` for images vs `(current,name)` for notes, fed to `relink`. Breaks if gone: image rename no longer rewrites `![[old]]→![[new]]` links.
- `src/shell/menu.rs:231-237` (`Do::CopyLink`): `(true,_) => format!("![[{}]]", graph::image_name(path))`, `(_,true) => graph::image_name(path)` (table), `is_attachment => [[name]]`, else `[[stem]]`. Breaks if gone: copy-link for images/tables/attachments.
- `src/views/nav.rs:747` (`tree_rows`, pictures area): `images.iter().map(|p| (p.as_path(), graph::image_name(p)))` chained after `notes→name`. Breaks if gone: tree picture labels (sorted per-folder with `vault::natural`).
- `src/views/editor/mod.rs:580-584` (`Editor::set_images`): `.map(|p| (graph::image_name(p).to_lowercase(), p.clone()))` into `self.images`. Breaks if gone: whole picture lookup map (`find_picture` fallback by name, `![[…]]`/completion `![[`, layout image resolution).

Relocation note: trivial 4-line pure fn; nearest neighbours are `vault::stem` (stem w/o extension, wrong for images) and private `logic/markdown/mod.rs:854 file_name` (borrowed `rsplit('/')`, not `Path`). Move to `platform/vault.rs` or `views/editor/mod.rs` next to `find_picture`.

